{"text":"I wept, as I am doing now, because it was so hard. It seems like this is what I do best, really. I wept because it was so hard to admit that I wanted to be something so improbable and impractical for a Kenyan like myself. It felt like a lofty pipe dream, really. But deep down I was overjoyed because I was finally speaking the truth about what made me feel most alive. And it wasn't real until I shared it. John Lennon put it best. A dream you dream alone is only a dream. A dream you dream together is reality.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.84,"end":1.44},{"text":"wept","start":1.44,"end":2.04,"punct":","},{"text":"as","start":2.26,"end":2.62},{"text":"I","start":2.62,"end":2.8},{"text":"am","start":2.8,"end":2.92},{"text":"doing","start":2.92,"end":3.22},{"text":"now","start":3.22,"end":3.78,"punct":","},{"text":"because","start":5.0,"end":5.68},{"text":"it","start":5.68,"end":6.44},{"text":"was","start":6.44,"end":6.56},{"text":"so","start":6.56,"end":6.9},{"text":"hard","start":6.9,"end":7.66,"punct":"."},{"text":"It","start":15.36,"end":15.96},{"text":"seems","start":15.96,"end":16.56},{"text":"like","start":16.56,"end":16.74},{"text":"this","start":16.74,"end":16.9},{"text":"is","start":16.9,"end":17.0},{"text":"what","start":17.0,"end":17.12},{"text":"I","start":17.12,"end":17.24},{"text":"do","start":17.24,"end":17.42},{"text":"best","start":17.42,"end":17.72,"punct":","},{"text":"really","start":17.8,"end":18.06,"punct":"."},{"text":"I","start":21.78,"end":22.38},{"text":"wept","start":22.38,"end":22.62},{"text":"because","start":22.62,"end":22.84},{"text":"it","start":22.84,"end":22.96},{"text":"was","start":22.96,"end":23.12},{"text":"so","start":23.12,"end":23.4},{"text":"hard","start":23.4,"end":23.92},{"text":"to","start":23.92,"end":24.14},{"text":"admit","start":24.14,"end":24.48},{"text":"that","start":24.48,"end":24.88},{"text":"I","start":24.88,"end":25.1},{"text":"wanted","start":25.1,"end":25.42},{"text":"to","start":25.42,"end":25.64},{"t